kadam 0.4

The page fades in when it opens.
Pages fade into each other when you move between them.

Hero section:
    It has 64px padding. It is at least 360px tall.
    The background is a #1E3A8A to #3B82F6 gradient from left to right.
    When the cursor moves over it, white pixels pop out around the cursor.
    A big white heading says "Meet Lumen." It appears word by word.
    White text, 18px, says "Lumen helps you get the most out of AI for the least spent."
    A highlight sweeps under "least spent".
    A big white button with black text says "Download". When hovered, a #DBEAFE fill slides in from the left. It ripples when pressed.

Glow section:
    It has 64px padding. It has a #111827 background.
    When the cursor moves over it, a #A78BFA glow follows the cursor.
    A big heading says "Glow". Its text is a #A78BFA to #F472B6 gradient.
    White text says "Grain, glow and spotlight follow the cursor." It types itself.
    A black button says "Shine". When hovered, a shine sweeps across it. It pulls toward the cursor.
    A #C4B5FD link says "Border". When hovered, its border draws itself. When clicked, go to page "Home".

Cards section:
    It has 64px padding.
    A heading says "Cards". It scrambles into place.
    Text says "This line tilts as you scroll." It tilts as you scroll.
